{"overview":"قوی‌ترین خوانندگان از سرتاسر ایالات متحده در یک مسابقه آواز بزرگ شرکت می‌کنند؛ برنده عنوان «صدای برتر» را به دست می‌آورد. قالب نوآورانه این برنامه شامل چهار مرحله مسابقه است: آزمون‌های کور، دورهای نبرد، دورهای حذف و در نهایت نمایش‌های زنده.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The strongest vocalists from across the United states compete in a blockbusters vocal competition, the winner becomes “The Voice.” The show's innovative format features four stages of competition: the blind auditions, the battle rounds, the knockouts and, finally, the live performance shows.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":4,"y":2011,"poster":"/lsXbfael8KrSC2N0Q5MmTAcJJao.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2011,"poster":"/x3mPkF36WFb8tN4vk4cVOf7zsTl.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":21,"y":2012,"poster":"/xvALjDmiqG9mHH9Apl5DwyXlVwC.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":32,"y":2012,"poster":"/uC0WRz2FR5LNsPYtaZFgb6yYjWK.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":28,"y":2013,"poster":"/7vnBywXQJsbjwCuIogQc1n2COOZ.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":27,"y":2013,"poster":"/3F6iS67Io50rFX6oDvgRvzvlBSP.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":27,"y":2014,"poster":"/m3lvpl2hRAxnOcDmeu6NA6ewysn.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":27,"y":2014,"poster":"/wDS7T3KeDyftZj2toEM6knquS4o.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":29,"y":2015,"poster":"/fYlN7WPIsrlSs3I9SoVhXyYOIWg.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":27,"y":2015,"poster":"/i9Fzu7WNFR1ckYv7HBn468Iu5PQ.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":28,"y":2016,"poster":"/r6ci8oA4HqZZ8oHsWoF9alXWJw8.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":26,"y":2016,"poster":"/bEJh4h0wxIfkkUJn6LpEaumEkPn.jpg"},{"n":12,"name":"فصل 12","ep":28,"y":2017,"poster":"/g9j0WsIBpOj6r0tCD7TANCTejQT.jpg"},{"n":13,"name":"فصل 13","ep":28,"y":2017,"poster":"/rSGtt7mmWQ3XsOIkkOAZ67lUHfe.jpg"},{"n":14,"name":"فصل 14","ep":29,"y":2018,"poster":"/i1Vymr9seN1WHtTojZY6EXijW1X.jpg"},{"n":15,"name":"فصل 15","ep":27,"y":2018,"poster":"/8JqzFwByku4OsPSCBpnpZFWdOWH.jp